    {
      "heading": "说明",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"markdown\"><h4>【数据范围】</h4>\n<p>对于全部数据，保证有 <span class=\"katex math inline\">1 \\le n  \\le 10^5 </span>。</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>子任务编号</th><th>数据点占比</th><th><span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"katex math inline\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"katex math inline\">20\\%</span></td><td><span class=\"katex math inline\">\\le 20</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"katex math inline\">40\\%</span></td><td><span class=\"katex math inline\">\\le 1000</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"katex math inline\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"katex math inline\">40\\%</span></td><td><span class=\"katex math inline\">\\le 10^5</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h4>样例 <span class=\"katex math inline\">1</span> 解释</h4>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">18=9+9=16+1+1</span> 其中最少需要 <span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span> 个完全平方数。</p>\n</div>\n\n                    \n                </div>",
